clocf - cloc formatter

Usage:
  cloc [options] <path> | clocf        # Process cloc output
  clocf [options] <path>               # Run cloc automatically
  clocf --help                         # Show this help

Examples:
  cloc . | clocf                       # Pipe cloc output
  clocf src/                           # Auto-run cloc on src/
  clocf --exclude-dir=vendor .         # Pass options to cloc
